- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

08:07.827 --> 08:10.000
YOU'’RE RIGHT ON TIME
FOR OUR PLAYDATE.
您来得正是时候
为了我们的玩伴。

08:10.000 --> 08:11.965
- WHOA.
I CAN'’T WAIT--
- 哇哦。
我等不及了——

08:11.965 --> 08:14.137
- TO DITCH YOU.
- 抛弃你。

08:14.137 --> 08:16.689
- '’CAUSE YOU'’RE MY BEST FRIEND.
- 因为你是我最好的朋友。

08:16.689 --> 08:17.862
- SO BEAT IT, TUBBY.
- 所以，打败它吧，塔比。

08:17.862 --> 08:19.413
I DON'’T CARE FOR YOUR COMPANY.
我不关心你们的公司。

08:19.413 --> 08:21.862
- WELL, PATRICK,
ARE YOU READY TO HAVE SOME FUN?
- 好吧，帕特里克，
您准备好享受乐趣了吗？

08:21.862 --> 08:23.689
- I DON'’T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

08:23.689 --> 08:27.517
[sobs]
[抽泣]

08:27.517 --> 08:30.448
[sobbing continues]
[抽泣继续]

08:30.448 --> 08:34.172
- THAT'’S WEIRD.
- 这很奇怪。

08:34.172 --> 08:36.551
I WONDER WHAT'’S WRONG
WITH PATRICK.
我想知道出了什么问题
与帕特里克。

08:36.551 --> 08:38.068
- DON'’T YOU REMEMBER?
- 你不记得了吗？

08:38.068 --> 08:40.344
WE TOLD THAT PINK FREAK
TO BEAT IT.
我们告诉过那个粉红怪胎
打败它。

08:40.344 --> 08:43.241
IN FACT, WE'’VE ALREADY INSULTED
ALL OF YOUR ROTTEN FRIENDS,
事实上，我们已经被侮辱了
你们所有的烂朋友，

08:43.241 --> 08:44.620
AND NOBODY
WILL HANG AROUND WITH YOU
和没有人
会和你在一起

08:44.620 --> 08:46.206
'’CAUSE YOU HAVE NO FRIENDS LEFT,
因为你没有朋友了，

08:46.206 --> 08:48.862
MR. LOSERBOB LONELYPANTS.
先生。 LOSERBOB 孤独裤。

08:48.862 --> 08:50.310
[laughs]
[笑]

08:50.310 --> 08:52.344
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:52.344 --> 08:53.344
OH, NO.
哦，不。

08:53.344 --> 08:54.620
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

08:54.620 --> 08:56.068
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

08:56.068 --> 08:57.517
PATRICK! PATRICK! PATRICK!
帕特里克！帕特里克！帕特里克！

08:57.517 --> 08:59.448
- YES, MAY I HELP YOU?
- 是的，我可以帮你吗？

08:59.448 --> 09:01.103
- YES, PATRICK!
- 是的，帕特里克！

09:01.103 --> 09:03.724
HELP ME GET THIS ABRASIVE SIDE
OFF MY BACK.
帮我得到这个磨料面
别管我了。

09:03.724 --> 09:05.310
YOU'’LL HELP ME,
WON'’T YOU, BUDDY?
你会帮助我，
你不想吗，伙计？

09:05.310 --> 09:07.517
- I DON'’T KNOW.
ARE WE BUDDIES?
- 我不知道。
我们是朋友吗？

09:07.517 --> 09:09.379
- PATRICK, YOU KNOW
THE ANSWER TO THAT QUESTION IS--
- 帕特里克，你知道的
这个问题的答案是——

09:09.379 --> 09:10.551
- NO.
- 不。

09:10.551 --> 09:11.620
WHY WOULD I WANT TO BE FRIENDS
我为什么想成为朋友

09:11.620 --> 09:13.344
WITH A BIG LOSER LIKE YOU?
面对像你这样的大失败者？

09:13.344 --> 09:15.379
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:15.379 --> 09:17.517
I'’M SO CONFUSED.
我很困惑。

09:17.517 --> 09:18.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:18.586 --> 09:19.862
IT HAPPENED AGAIN!
又发生了！

09:19.862 --> 09:21.206
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:21.206 --> 09:23.103
- IT'’S UNBELIEVABLE.
- 难以置信。

09:23.103 --> 09:26.448
"MORE MONEY
FOR SERVICE ABOVE AND BEYOND..."
“更多的钱
服务超越……”

09:26.448 --> 09:28.034
[indistinct muttering]
slam!
[含糊不清的嘀咕声]
猛击！

09:28.034 --> 09:29.310
- MR. KRABS!
MR. KRABS!
- 先生。螃蟹！
先生。螃蟹！

09:29.310 --> 09:30.758
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:30.758 --> 09:33.137
WHAT DO YOU WANT NOW,
MR. POTTY MOUTH?
你现在想要什么，
先生。便盆口？

09:33.137 --> 09:34.551
- BUT, MR. KRABS,
-但是，先生。螃蟹，

09:34.551 --> 09:36.586
I NEVER USE IMMODERATE LANGUAGE,
LIKE--
我从不使用不恰当的语言，
喜欢--

09:36.586 --> 09:38.724
- OVERTIME.
snap!
- 随着时间的推移。
折断！

09:38.724 --> 09:39.827
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:39.827 --> 09:41.000
OUT.
出去。

09:41.000 --> 09:42.551
OUT.
AND STAY OUT.
出去。
并远离。

09:42.551 --> 09:44.068
AND DON'’T YOU COME BACK
你不回来吗

09:44.068 --> 09:45.689
TILL YOU'’VE SWABBED
THAT POOP DECK
直到你擦拭完毕
那个船尾甲板

09:45.689 --> 09:47.517
YOU CALL A MOUTH.
你称之为嘴。

09:47.517 --> 09:51.482
[mutters angrily]
[愤怒地嘀咕]

09:51.482 --> 09:52.586
- SANDY.
PLEASE, HELP ME.
- 桑迪。
请帮我。

09:52.586 --> 09:54.413
GARY ORDERED ME AN ABRASIVE SIDE
加里给我订了一块磨料面

09:54.413 --> 09:55.689
SO THAT I COULD BE MORE
ASSERTIVE--
这样我就可以做得更多
有主见--

09:55.689 --> 09:57.034
- HEY, CHIPMUNK.
- 嘿，花栗鼠。

09:57.034 --> 09:59.517
- BUT NOW IT'’S TAKEN OVER.
- 但现在它已经被接管了。

09:59.517 --> 10:01.034
- QUIET, YOU.
- 安静，你。

10:01.034 --> 10:02.310
- I CAN'’T TAKE IT ANYMORE.
- 我再也受不了了。

10:02.310 --> 10:05.137
IT'’S LIKE A--A VIRUS.
它就像一种病毒。

10:05.137 --> 10:06.310
- [indistinct murmuring]
- [含糊不清的低语]

10:06.310 --> 10:07.724
- HUH?
UH, HOLD ON.
- 嗯？
呃，坚持住。

10:07.724 --> 10:09.241
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

10:09.241 --> 10:11.172
[inflating]
pop!
[充气]
噗！

10:11.172 --> 10:13.413
- I SAID,
"WHAT'’D YOU WANT TO GO DO
- 我说，
“你想去做什么

10:13.413 --> 10:14.689
A DANG FOOL THING
LIKE THAT FOR?"
一件愚蠢的事情
喜欢这样吗？”

10:14.689 --> 10:16.586
- WELL, I JUST COULDN'’T SAY...
- 好吧，我只是不能说……

10:16.586 --> 10:18.517
- NO.
- TO ANYBODY.
- 不。
- 对任何人。

10:18.517 --> 10:21.620
SO I GOT THIS ABRASIVE SIDE
TO HELP CHANGE MY PERSONALITY.
所以我得到了这个磨料面
帮助改变我的性格。

10:21.620 --> 10:23.482
- AW, SPONGEBOB,
- 噢，海绵宝宝，

10:23.482 --> 10:25.034
DON'’T GO TRYIN'’ TO BE SOMEONE
YOU'’RE NOT.
不要试图成为某个人
你不是。

10:25.034 --> 10:26.448
YOU ARE WHO YOU ARE.
你就是你。

10:26.448 --> 10:29.379
AND WHO YOU ARE IS JUST FINE.
你是谁就很好。

10:29.379 --> 10:31.862
- WHO HE IS JUST STINKS.
- 他是谁真是臭极了。

10:31.862 --> 10:33.482
- GOLLY!
- 天啊！

10:33.482 --> 10:34.965
WE GOT TO GET THIS VARMINT
OFF YOU.
我们必须抓住这个恶鼠
关你。

10:34.965 --> 10:36.206
NOW TURN AROUND.
现在转身。

10:36.206 --> 10:39.379
AND GRAB SOMETHIN'’ HEAVY.
并抓住一些重的东西。

10:39.379 --> 10:40.862
NOW, HOLD STILL.
现在，保持不动。

10:40.862 --> 10:43.344
- NO!
YOU DON'’T SCARE ME, GIRLY.
- 不！
你别吓到我，姑娘。

10:43.344 --> 10:45.206
- THIS IS GONNA STING
WORSE THAN A JELLYFISH
- 这会刺痛
比水母还糟糕

10:45.206 --> 10:46.896
IN A BUCKET OF ELECTRIC EELS.
一桶电鳗。

10:46.896 --> 10:48.000
- HEY, WHAT ARE YOU DOING,
- 嘿，你在做什么，

10:48.000 --> 10:49.827
YOU CRAZY BUSHY-TAILED RODENT?
你是疯狂的浓尾啮齿动物吗？

10:49.827 --> 10:52.172
- OW!
[gasps]
- 噢！
[喘气]

10:52.172 --> 10:55.137
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:55.137 --> 10:56.551
- ALL DONE.
- 全部完成。

10:56.551 --> 10:58.275
- WHEW.
THANK YOU, SANDY.
- 哇。
谢谢你，桑迪。

10:58.275 --> 10:59.344
YOU TOO, PATRICK.
你也是，帕特里克。

10:59.344 --> 11:01.862
- NO PROBLEM.
- 没问题。

11:01.862 --> 11:03.655
- [growls menacingly]
- [威胁地咆哮]

11:03.655 --> 11:05.413
- I THINK IT'’S HIGH TIME
WE GET RID OF THIS CRITTER.
- 我认为现在是时候了
我们摆脱这个生物。

11:11.965 --> 11:13.482
- SO LONG, ABRASIVEY.
- 再见，磨料。

11:13.482 --> 11:15.275
- [growls menacingly]
- [威胁地咆哮]

11:15.275 --> 11:16.758
- GRANDMA.
- 奶奶。

11:16.758 --> 11:17.827
I'’VE GOT TO APOLOGIZE
TO GRANDMA.
我必须道歉
致奶奶。

11:21.620 --> 11:23.034
[knocking]
[敲门声]

11:23.034 --> 11:24.862
GRANDMA?
奶奶？

11:24.862 --> 11:28.275
HELLO?
你好？

11:28.275 --> 11:31.862
GRANDMA,
I'’M SORRY ABOUT EARLIER TODAY.
奶奶，
我对今天早些时候的事感到抱歉。

11:31.862 --> 11:33.206
SO WHAT DO YOU SAY?
那么你怎么说？

11:33.206 --> 11:34.896
CAN WE DISCUSS FORGIVENESS
我们可以讨论宽恕吗

11:34.896 --> 11:37.206
OVER A CUP
OF YOUR FAMOUS HOT COCOA?
一杯以上
您著名的热可可吗？

11:37.206 --> 11:38.586
- OH, MY SWEET,
- 哦，亲爱的，

11:38.586 --> 11:40.379
I WOULD LOVE
TO WHIP THAT UP FOR YOU
我会喜欢
为您做好准备

11:40.379 --> 11:42.482
RIGHT AFTER YOU...
就在你之后...

11:42.482 --> 11:44.310
- MAKE YOUR OWN HOT COCOA!
- 制作你自己的热可可！

11:44.310 --> 11:45.344
I'’M BUSY.
我很忙。

11:45.344 --> 11:46.344
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

11:46.344 --> 11:48.827
- NO!
- 不！

12:01.103 --> 12:03.551
- ♪ DOO-DOO-DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO-DOO DOO-DOO ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟嘟♪

12:03.551 --> 12:05.172
♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟 ♪

12:05.172 --> 12:06.586
♪ DOO-DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

12:06.586 --> 12:09.310
♪ TRYING TO STOP IT IS FUTILE ♪
♪ 试图阻止它是徒劳的 ♪

12:09.310 --> 12:10.793
♪ SO JUST LISTEN NOW ♪
♪ 所以现在就听吧 ♪

12:10.793 --> 12:13.172
♪ TO MY MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 我的音乐涂鸦 ♪

12:13.172 --> 12:15.275
♪ DOO-DOO DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
- GRR!
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 嘟嘟嘟 ♪
- 咕噜！

12:15.275 --> 12:16.931
- ♪ DOO DOO ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟 ♪

12:16.931 --> 12:21.137
- WOULD YOU STOP
THAT INCESSANT BABBLING?
- 你能停下来吗
那种喋喋不休的胡言乱语？

12:21.137 --> 12:22.275
- THOWWY, THQUIDWAD.
- 索威，特奎德瓦德。

12:22.275 --> 12:23.344
- GRR!
- 咕噜！

12:23.344 --> 12:25.000
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

12:25.000 --> 12:26.482
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
IT'’S CLOSIN'’ TIME.
你在干什么？
关门时间到了。

12:26.482 --> 12:28.586
NOW, GET OUT THERE
AND SWAB THE POOP DECK.
现在，出去吧
并擦拭船尾甲板。

12:28.586 --> 12:30.241
- AYE-AYE, MEIN CAPITAN.
- 是的，我的船长。

12:30.241 --> 12:33.586
♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟♪

12:33.586 --> 12:37.517
♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO DOO DOO DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟嘟♪

12:37.517 --> 12:38.862
♪ DOO-DOO DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

12:38.862 --> 12:40.241
♪ I'’M MOPPING AND I'’M SINGING ♪
♪ 我一边拖地一边唱歌 ♪

12:40.241 --> 12:42.551
♪ ABOUT THE MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 关于音乐涂鸦 ♪

12:42.551 --> 12:44.965
♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟♪

12:44.965 --> 12:49.689
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

12:49.689 --> 12:52.034
- WOULD YOU QUIT IT
WITH THAT TUNE ALREADY?
- 你愿意放弃吗
已经有了那个曲调了吗？

12:52.034 --> 12:54.344
- SORRY, IT'’S JUST SO CATCHY.
- 抱歉，它太吸引人了。

12:54.344 --> 12:58.724
- I DON'’T CARE.
JUST CAN IT.
- 我不在乎。
就是可以。

12:58.724 --> 13:00.379
I'’LL CLEANSE MYSELF
我会净化自己

13:00.379 --> 13:02.793
BY LISTENING
TO A LITTLE PUBLIC RADIO.
通过聆听
收听小型公共广播电台。

13:02.793 --> 13:04.172
- ♪ DOO DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟嘟 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

13:04.172 --> 13:05.793
♪ DOO-DOO DOO DOO DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟 ♪

13:05.793 --> 13:07.068
- OOH!
- 哦！

13:07.068 --> 13:08.793
IT'’S MUSICAL DOODLE,SQUIDWARD.
这是音乐涂鸦，《章鱼哥》。

13:08.793 --> 13:11.931
♪ ROUND AND ROUND
THE RECORD SPINS ALL DAY ♪
♪ 一圈又一圈
记录一整天都在旋转 ♪

13:11.931 --> 13:14.793
♪ LISTEN AGAIN,
IT TAKES YOU FAR AWAY ♪
♪ 再听一遍，
它带你走得很远♪

13:14.793 --> 13:17.586
♪ TRYING TO STOP IT IS FUTILE ♪
♪ 试图阻止它是徒劳的 ♪

13:17.586 --> 13:22.275
♪ SO JUST LISTEN NOW
TO MY MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 现在就听吧
致我的音乐涂鸦 ♪

13:22.275 --> 13:25.758
♪ DOO-DOO DOO-DOO
DOO DOO DOO DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟♪

13:25.758 --> 13:28.896
- FIGURES YOU WOULD BE INTO
THAT HIDEOUS POP FODDER.
- 您会喜欢的数字
那个可怕的流行饲料。

13:28.896 --> 13:31.103
- IT'’S A SIGN.
- 这是一个标志。

13:31.103 --> 13:33.103
- A SIGN
THAT YOU'’RE A TRUE BOOB?
- 一个标志
你是真布布吗？

13:33.103 --> 13:34.724
- YES!
NO.
- 是的！
不。

13:34.724 --> 13:37.103
THAT THIS SONG AND I
WERE MEANT TO BE TOGETHER.
这首歌和我
我们注定要在一起。

13:37.103 --> 13:39.206
- GREAT.
NOW I HATE TWO THINGS.
- 伟大的。
现在我讨厌两件事。

13:39.206 --> 13:41.103
- ALL RIGHT, BOYS,
TIME TO GO HO--
- 好吧，孩子们，
是时候出发了——

13:41.103 --> 13:43.206
- [maniacal laughter]
- [疯狂的笑声]

13:43.206 --> 13:45.137
FREEDOM!
自由！

13:45.137 --> 13:48.586
- OKAY, SPONGEBOB,
TIME TO HIT THE ROAD.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，
是时候上路了。

13:48.586 --> 13:50.103
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

13:50.103 --> 13:51.310
[Musical Doodle
playing on radio]
[音乐涂鸦
在广播中播放]

13:51.310 --> 13:52.344
- ♪ DOO-DOO-DOO DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟嘟 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

13:52.344 --> 13:53.413
♪ DOO-DOO DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

13:53.413 --> 13:54.896
♪ DOO DOO-DOO-DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

13:54.896 --> 13:56.758
♪ THE MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 音乐涂鸦 ♪

13:56.758 --> 14:00.482
♪ LISTEN AGAIN
TO THE MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 再听一遍
音乐涂鸦 ♪

14:00.482 --> 14:02.827
- AND THAT'’S THE NEW SONG
BY THE SONARS
- 这就是新歌
通过声纳

14:02.827 --> 14:04.724
CALLED MUSICAL DOODLE.
称为音乐涂鸦。

14:04.724 --> 14:07.275
- AH, MUSICAL DOODLE.
- 啊，音乐涂鸦。

14:07.275 --> 14:08.379
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

14:08.379 --> 14:10.206
- OOPS.
GOOD NIGHT, SIR.
- 哎呀。
晚安，先生。

14:10.206 --> 14:13.034
