音乐涂鸦 ♪

14:26.482 --> 14:30.103
♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO-DOO-DOO DOO DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟♪

14:30.103 --> 14:32.586
- ♪ DOO DOO DOO-DOO-DOO
DOO-DOO-DOO DOO DOO ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟♪

14:32.586 --> 14:36.655
♪ YOU'’RE GONNA LISTEN AGAIN
TO THE MUSICAL DOODLE ♪
♪ 你会再听一遍
音乐涂鸦 ♪

